{:edb/db-before-t 1210 :edb/db-after-t 1211 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534523 50 #inst "2026-10-07T20:09:54.167Z" 13194139534523 true] [17592186092323 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293067 13194139534523 true] [17592186092323 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293074 13194139534523 true] [17592186092324 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293060 13194139534523 true] [17592186092324 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293081 13194139534523 true] [17592186092324 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293085 13194139534523 true] [17592186293060 1017 #edb/ref 17592186293061 13194139534523 true] [17592186293060 1089 "q-10258" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293060 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534523 true] [17592186293060 1100 "Find the arc length of the curve defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=2(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t),\\,y=2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t),\\,t\\in [0,\\pi ].\n$$" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293060 1113 #uuid "cb154f08-6559-53b7-a400-880200f1e12f" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293060 1145 "To compute the arc length $L$ of a parametrically defined curve, we use the formula\n\n$$\nL={\\int }_{{t}_{1}}^{{t}_{2}}\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nComputing the derivatives of $x$ and $y,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t) \\\\  & =2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)) \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t) \\\\  & =2t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute these derivatives in the formula for arc length and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & ={\\int }_{{t}_{1}}^{{t}_{2}}\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\sqrt{{(2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)}^{2}+{(2t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\sqrt{4{t}^{2}({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\cdot {\\frac{{t}^{2}}{2}|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =2(\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{2}-0) \\\\  & ={\\pi }^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293062 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293063 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293064 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293065 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293066 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1041 "selection" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293066 13194139534523 true] [17592186293061 1110 #uuid "25eeb9f8-033d-5747-aea9-ee634ba6fa53" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293062 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293062 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534523 true] [17592186293062 1111 #uuid "423803cf-f495-5387-8d96-c0349a4f6072" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293063 1034 "2{\\pi }^{2}" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293063 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534523 true] [17592186293063 1111 #uuid "fdd65c43-ddc8-5344-b3b9-3702eed0dce3" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293064 1034 "\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{4}" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293064 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534523 true] [17592186293064 1111 #uuid "f0c29155-bdc8-5348-a88b-52111ff9b6fb" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293065 1034 "\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{2}" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293065 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534523 true] [17592186293065 1111 #uuid "5631dfe0-b479-5513-aca5-2762fb01e883" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293066 1034 "{\\pi }^{2}" 13194139534523 true] [17592186293066 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453